{"name": "Stardream", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"102\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/034ca56e529a42416077e5b3e78dc491.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2119! This year marks the 150 years after the launch of Stardream in 1969. The atomic-propelled <strong>space ark</strong> jets at half-light speed toward K2-18b: <strong>the new Earth</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One million people thrive aboard! An <strong>idyllic society</strong>, where you can live a perfectly ordered, peaceful, melamine-laminated, microwave-safe life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entire generations of passengers are born, live and die on Stardream! And you are one of them. <strong>Lucky you</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/1b61a9971365407ff600e9e4b491f90a.poster.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/1b61a9971365407ff600e9e4b491f90a.webm?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/1b61a9971365407ff600e9e4b491f90a.mp4?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"88\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/9a2c4064b3b736ab04ed960d7d06567b.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stardream is so big! One wouldn\u2019t <i>walk</i> to their neighborhood synthetic meat barbecue, would they? <strong>Cars</strong>, passenger! Call a taxi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Except that <strong>you are the taxi</strong>. Everyone has a duty to perform\u2014one of them is working! Stardream will not run by itself, would it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A good job to <strong>drive anywhere you want</strong>\u2014as long as you stay abroad, ha ha ha! \u2014Comedy, am I right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A good job to <strong>listen to conversations</strong>, <strong>ask questions</strong>, meet people,<strong> </strong>learn where they live,<strong> </strong>outrun Mediators! An exciting life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/16a736529785ef7a7292c4cace12ee69.poster.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/16a736529785ef7a7292c4cace12ee69.webm?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/16a736529785ef7a7292c4cace12ee69.mp4?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"88\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/4c8f33e52ca946626bc8971ea3160978.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate</strong> suspicious behaviors, <strong>search for clues</strong>, take part in <strong>secret meetings</strong>, look for your missing friends. <strong>Infiltrate</strong> the Crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please, don\u2019t do that. There is nothing to uncover. This Steam page has already been flagged as disruptive. <strong>Mediators are on the way</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/767397f6bf19875b08746c08af496fd2.poster.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/767397f6bf19875b08746c08af496fd2.webm?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/767397f6bf19875b08746c08af496fd2.mp4?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"88\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/d6d75d961d5ae702e61a9d4119db5139.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the true nature of Stardream</strong>, and decide what to do with the truth. Will anyone ever believe you? <strong>Your choices</strong> could very much <strong>shape the future of humanity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You are in violation of the Article 32\u2013709 of the Duty Code.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please refrain from reading further.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/abf3b5110b182f6063f820060c11fcb4.poster.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/abf3b5110b182f6063f820060c11fcb4.webm?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/abf3b5110b182f6063f820060c11fcb4.mp4?t=1777908182\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"88\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/25191ee57f7e4e9a8f2b4c408b811c7f.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a living retrofuturist space ark</strong>, where every location reveals a glimpse of truth under <strong>the big lie</strong> of the Skydome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a cast of <strong>complex characters</strong>, brought to life through <strong>meaningful conversations</strong> and the <strong>cinematic performances</strong> of Alexandra Robini, Ryan Highley, Aimee Parvitt, Caroline Ribot and Amandine Barbier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let\u2019s meet under the Skydome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/4cdad6f889761d61adfb2ab4a6e8b0ee.avif?t=1777908182\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Stardream is a story-driven investigation game set in a retro 60s-inspired space ark. As Darlene, a taxi driver turned into a pressured investigator, uncover a hidden truth that could shatter a perfect society.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/9c3b362b54992f7ba4586096fac05ce2d3243099/header.jpg?t=1777908182", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Story Rich", "Exploration", "Atmospheric", "Driving", "Stylized"], "developers": "Rebel Pixel", "publishers": "Rebel Pixel", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3654740", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0ICoqw4FxY0", "first_se